Hi <%= @employee.display_name.presence || "there" %>,

<%= @content["greeting"].presence || @content["intro"].presence || "Here is your private workflow digest." %>

What we heard from you:
<% heard = Array(@content["heard"])
   heard = Array(@content["insights"]).map { |i| i["summary"] } if heard.empty? %>
<% heard.first(5).each do |item| %>
- <%= item %>
<% end %>

<% tips = Array(@content["tips"]) %>
<% if tips.any? %>
Practical tips:
<% tips.each do |item| %>
- <%= item %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

<% tools = Array(@content["tools"])
   tools = Array(@content["suggested_tools"]).map { |t| { "name" => t["name"], "why" => t["why_it_fits"] } } if tools.empty? %>
<% if tools.any? %>
Tools that may help your role:
<% tools.each do |tool| %>
- <%= tool["name"] %><%= (tool["why"].presence || tool["why_it_fits"]).present? ? " — #{tool["why"].presence || tool["why_it_fits"]}" : "" %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

<% if @content["team_theme"].present? %>
<%= @content["team_theme"] %>
<% end %>

<%= @content["privacy_note"].presence || "This digest never includes other employees' data." %>

Thank you,
<%= @company.display_name || @company.name %> via Req
